   "title": "Rio Grande Wild & Scenic River (U.S. National Park Service)",
   "text": "An official website of the United States government\nSearch or ask anything\nAsk DOI Anything - How Can We Help?\nHelp me plan a visit to the Rio Grande Wild & Scenic River\nAre there alerts or closures at the Rio Grande Wild & Scenic River?\nWhat's on the calendar at the Rio Grande Wild & Scenic River this week?\nWhat is there to do at the Rio Grande Wild & Scenic River?\nSkip to global NPS navigation\nSkip to this park navigation\nSkip to the main content\nSkip to this park information section\nSkip to the footer section\nNational Park Service\nOpen\nMenu\nRio Grande\nWild & Scenic River • Texas\nFor 196 miles, this free-flowing stretch of the Rio Grande winds its way through desert expanses and stunning canyons of stratified rock. For the well prepared, an extended float trip provides opportunities to explore the most remote corner of Texas and experience the ultimate in solitude, self-reliance, and immersion in natural soundscapes.\nPlan your visit\nAbout the park\nPlan Your Visit\nLearn About the Park\nGet Involved\nInfo\nAlerts\nMaps\nCalendar\nFees\nPlan Your Visit\nThe Rio Grande serves as the southern boundary of Big Bend National Park.\nLearn About the Park\nThe Rio Grande flows through some of the most spectacular landscapes in the American West.\nLast updated: August 21, 2023\nWas this page helpful?\nYes\nNo\nAn official form of the United States government. Provided by Touchpoints\nVISITOR GUIDE\nThe Big Bend Paisano Visitor Guide\nBE PREPARED\nCurrent Conditions\nJUST THE FACTS!\nFact Sheet\nRANGER IN YOUR POCKET!\nNPS App\nPark footer\nCONTACT INFO\nMailing Address:\nRio Grande Wild & Scenic River\nc/o Big Bend National Park\nPO Box 129\nBig Bend National Park, TX 79834\nPhone:\n(432) 477-2251\nContact Us\nTOOLS\nFAQ\nSite Index\nEspañol\nSTAY CONNECTED\nExplore subjects and stories related to this park\nSUBJECT\nRivers\nSUBJECT\nHunting\nSUBJECT\nBirds & Birding\nSUBJECT\nHealth & Safety\nExperience Your America.\nDownload the NPS app to navigate the parks on the go.\nSearch\nAccessibility\nPrivacy Policy\nFOIA\nNotices\nContact Rio Grande Wild & Scenic River\nNPS FAQ\nNo Fear Act\nDisclaimer\nVulnerability Disclosure Policy\nUSA.gov\nOffice of Civil Rights\nLooking for U.S. government information and services? Visit USA.gov\nConnect with the parks you love by joining the National Park Foundation\nSign Up No Thanks",
